  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### How can I process the Zero FPS (zero payroll) for the employees?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 8 Nov, 2021 at  4:18 PM\n\n\t\tYou may select the “Zero Payroll” checkbox while processing the payroll then the payroll will be processed with the zero figures.\n\nPlease refer below screenshot for more help.\n\nClick here to watch how to process zero FPS / zero pay\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
